unity_vote\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Feastshadestudios.itch.io%2Fsongs-of-glimmerwick&amp;intent=community\" title=\"Vote up\" class=\"vote_up_btn vote_btn\"><svg height=\"20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" width=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" role=\"img\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_up\"><polygon points=\"2 18 12 6 22 18\" /></svg></a> <a data-register_action=\"community_vote\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Feastshadestudios.itch.io%2Fsongs-of-glimmerwick&amp;intent=community\" title=\"Vote down\" class=\"vote_down_btn vote_btn\"><svg height=\"20\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" width=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" role=\"img\" class=\"svgicon icon_vote_down\"><polygon points=\"2 6 12 18 22 6\" /></svg></a></div><a class=\"avatar_container\" href=\"https://itch.io/profile/cageysweepstakes159\"><div style=\"background-image: url(/static/images/frog.png)\" class=\"post_avatar\"></div></a><div class=\"post_header\"><span class=\"post_author\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/profile/cageysweepstakes159\">CageySweepstakes159</a></span><span title=\"2026-10-02 09:56:33\" class=\"post_date\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/post/17493485\">4 days ago</a></span><span class=\"vote_counts\"><span class=\"upvotes\">(+2)</span></span></div><div class=\"post_content\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"post_body user_formatted\"><p>The best voice acting I&#x27;ve ever encountered in a game. One of the very few times that voice overs have made a video game story captivate me enough to stop skipping through dialogue. <br>The underlying musical theme is not overbearing, and while the game mechanics can be challenging at first, you literally build coordination if you give it a few tries. <br>This game was well worth the wait after trying out the demo. The devs care and it shows.<br>The System Requirements are also very&nbsp;<span><span><span>accessible</span></span>.</span></p></div><div class=\"post_footer\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2F